ent-Medkit = 急救箱 | first aid kit
    .desc = 這是一款專為嚴重小傷勢準備的急救包。 | It's an emergency medical kit for those serious boo-boos.
ent-MedkitBurn = 燒傷處理套組 (burn treatment kit) | burn treatment kit
    .desc = 一套專門用於毒素實驗室發生自燃時使用的醫療急救包。 | A specialized medical kit for when the toxins lab spontaneously burns down.
ent-MedkitToxin = 毒素處理套組 (toxin treatment kit) | toxin treatment kit
    .desc = 用於治療血液中的有毒物質。 | Used to treat toxic blood content.
ent-MedkitO2 = 缺氧治療套組 (oxygen deprivation treatment kit) | oxygen deprivation treatment kit
    .desc = 一個裝滿氧氣好物的盒子。 | A box full of oxygen goodies.
ent-MedkitBrute = 外傷急救包 (brute trauma treatment kit) | brute trauma treatment kit
    .desc = 當你遭遇「工具箱襲擊」時，這套急救包派上用場。 | A first aid kit for when you get toolboxed.
ent-MedkitAdvanced = 進階急救包 (advanced first aid kit) | advanced first aid kit
    .desc = 一套用於處理複雜傷口的高階急救套件。 | An advanced kit to help deal with advanced wounds.
ent-MedkitRadiation = 放射治療套件 (radiation treatment kit) | radiation treatment kit
    .desc = 如果你服用了 Rad-X，就不會需要這個了。 | If you took your Rad-X you wouldn't need this.
ent-MedkitCombat = 戰地急救包 (combat medical kit) | combat medical kit
    .desc = 獻給我們當中那些擁有重型武器的人。 | For the big weapons among us.
